{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26199","headline":"郊行逢社日 · 殷尧藩","name":"郊行逢社日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒熟送迎便，村村庆有年。\n妻孥亲稼穑，老稚効渔畋。\n红树青林外，黄芦白鸟边。\n稔看风景美，宁不羡归田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}